<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE -KLM Q1 net profit NLG 190 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE -KLM Q1 net profit NLG 190 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First  qtr 1997/98 to June 30.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   190     vs  271</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)	    2.57  vs    3.63</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   244     vs   80</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected KLM Royal Dutch Airlines to report a first-quarter net profit of 94-136 million guilders.  </p>
<p>   Traffic revenue (billions)		 2.45  vs    2.00</p>
<p>   Traffic revenue of consolidated units  428   vs  146</p>
<p>   Other revenue				  387   vs  306</p>
<p>   Total operating revenues (billions)    3.26  vs    2.45</p>
<p>   Total operating expenses (billions)    3.02  vs    2.37</p>
<p>   Financial charges			   54     vs   60</p>
<p>   Profit on asset sales			2     vs    5</p>
<p>   Income from Northwest Airlines	  56     vs   245</p>
<p>   Income from other holdings		19     vs    16</p>
<p>   Pre-tax profit			     267     vs   286</p>
<p>   Tax					     74     vs    15</p>
<p>   Minority interests			   3     vs    NIL</p>
<p>   Dividend on preference shares	    1     vs     4</p>
<p>   Attributable net profit		  189     vs   267</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
